    "body": "When I saw this email thread in my inbox I was anticipating not liking the change as it sounded like it'd be at odds with our existing use of `<dfn>` and `<i>`. But upon actually seeing the change, this makes total sense. I guess this sort of thing is more about phrases that we're referring back to, instead of about specific terms. Thanks for catching it!",
